# Study habits and Student Well being
## Purpose: This is a fictional class project for our psychology course. The purpose is to study how different study habits like time management and sleep affect the stress level and academic performance of university students.
## Files: This repository will contain the following files:                                                                      project_plan.docx - The main plan and timeline of our project                                                                  survey_draft.docx - Draft of the questionnaire we will use for students                                                        data_dictionary.xlsx - Explanation of variables and codes used in our analysis                                   
## Team rules                                                                                                                      All files should be named using lowercase with underscores, for example `final_report.docx.                                    Every changed must be committed with the clear message and informed in our WatsApp group.
## Privacy Reminder                                                                                                               No personal records, names, roll numbers, or any identifiable participant data will be uploaded to this repository to protect privacy.
